  "description": "Join the worldΓÇÖs largest treasure-hunting community with the official app for geocaching. Whether you are off to find your first geocache or your ten-thousandth, this app is your ultimate geocaching toolbox. \n\nThere are millions of clever containers called geocaches hidden in almost every country on Earth, just waiting to be foundΓÇöthere are probably even some near you right now.ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ Just getting started? This app walks you through the adventure of finding your first few geocaches. There are tips, hints, and instructions for geocaching as well as using the app.ΓÇ¿\nCore Features: \nΓùÅ\tSee details with description, recent activity, attributes, and hints for each geocache\nΓùÅ\tNavigate to the cache using map, compass, or driving directions\nΓùÅ\tLive Search continuously updates nearby geocaches as you move\nΓùÅ\tFind all easy Traditional geocaches and geocaching events\nΓùÅ\tMessage other players for tips, hints, and more\nΓùÅ\tLearn about trackables: geocaching game pieces that travel from geocache to geocache\nΓùÅ\tAdjust your navigation and distance settings to your personal preference \nΓùÅ\tAccess to GeoTour caches of all cache types and D/T ratingsΓÇ¿\nSearch and Sorting:\nΓùÅ\tSearch for GC codes, locations, landmarks, and neighborhoods\nΓùÅ\tSearch for GeoTours by GT code or see a directory of all GeoTours worldwide\nΓùÅ\tSort by distance \n\nTrackables:\nΓùÅ\tSearch for trackables\nΓùÅ\tLog trackables - grab, retrieve, drop, dip, or discover\nΓùÅ\tView your trackable inventory\n\nLogging:\nΓùÅ\tLog a geocache now or save as a draft for later\nΓùÅ\tAdd photos to share your adventure\nΓùÅ\tImprove cache quality by reporting geocaches that need maintenance \n\nMap Options:\nΓùÅ\tStreet\nΓùÅ\tSatellite\nΓùÅ\tHybrid\n\n\nUnlock even more adventure with Geocaching Premium:\nΓùÅ\tFind any geocache in the world, including Premium Member Only caches\nΓùÅ\tFilter geocaches by size, type, difficulty, terrain, and found/owned\nΓùÅ\tSort lists of geocaches by distance, Favorite points, or geocache name\nΓùÅ\tGeocache anywhere, anytime with offline maps\nΓùÅ\tTake the road less traveled with Trails map\nΓùÅ\tPlan, add, or edit your next adventure with Lists\nΓùÅ\tAward Favorite points to geocaches you enjoy most\nΓùÅ\tAuto-sync Lists and Pocket Queries created on the Geocaching website\nΓùÅ\tGain access to all Premium features on the Geocaching website\n\nWe are committed to building the best tools for geocachers to create, share, and play this game. By joining and maintaining your Premium membership, you are helping to shape the future of Geocaching. In addition to your support of the game, Premium members also get access to more features, more geocaches, and more adventure.\n\nYou can buy a Premium membership subscription through your iTunes account. Premium membership is available with a monthly or annual subscription. You can subscribe and pay through your iTunes account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during active subscription period.\n\nTerms of use: https://www.geocaching.com/about/termsofuse.aspx",
